---
// Footer Component (Subdued Edge Footer)
---

<footer class="relative z-20 border-t border-[#141418] bg-[#000000] py-6 px-4 lg:px-8 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-600 mt-16" data-purpose="footer-bar">
  <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
    
    <!-- Left: Edge Node Info -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-zinc-500">
      <span class="text-zinc-400 font-medium">ThunderRonin // Amirali Daliri</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-800">|</span>
      <span>Cloudflare Worker Edge</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-800">|</span>
      <span class="text-zinc-400">TLS 1.3</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Center: GitHub & Attribution -->
    <div class="text-zinc-600 text-[10px]">
      Built with Astro + Tailwind CSS. Designed for OLED low-luminance viewing.
    </div>

    <!-- Right: Back to Top -->
    <div>
      <a
        href="#hero"
        class="text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]"
      >
        <span>↑</span> TOP
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
